atus }}</span></span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></RouterLink></template><div class="safe-action-note"><strong>Try the workflow without changing a record.</strong><p>Signing, co-signing and completing a note only demonstrate the action. No signature or clinical record is saved.</p></div><RouterLink class="primary-button" :to="`/${slug}/documentation`" data-analytics-id="provider-documentation-open">Open Note Workspace →</RouterLink></template>
            <template v-else-if="profileTab === 'credentials'"><p class="eyebrow">CREDENTIALS & PROFESSIONAL DETAILS</p><h3>The essentials, easy to find</h3><div class="credential-card"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><div><strong>{{ selectedStaff.title }}</strong><p>{{ selectedStaff.license }}</p><span class="badge">Fictional credential · Product example</span></div></div><dl class="credential-facts"><div><dt>Credential</dt><dd>{{ selectedStaff.credential }}</dd></div><div><dt>Practice role</dt><dd>{{ selectedStaff.role_label }}</dd></div><div><dt>Example renewal</dt><dd>{{ date(demoDay(120), {year: 'numeric'}) }}</dd></div><div><dt>Supervision</dt><dd>{{ selectedStaff.supervisor_id ? 'Tessa Brooks, PhD · Supervisor assigned' : selectedStaff.id === 990113 ? 'Clinical supervisor for Milo Chen, LPCC' : 'Independent clinical provider' }}</dd></div><div><dt>Onboarding</dt><dd>Example checklist complete</dd></div></dl><button type="button" class="plotline-link" data-analytics-id="provider-tab" @click="profileTab = 'plotline'"><img class="plotline-logo" src="/assets/plotline/website/brand/logos/plotline-primary-transparent.webp" alt="Plotline" width="92" height="37"><span>See onboarding, learning & renewals in <strong>Plotline →</strong></span></button><p class="profile-copy">Credentials and renewal dates in this demo are invented. No verification or real licensing status is implied.</p></template>
            <template v-else-if="profileTab === 'responsibilities'"><p class="eyebrow">ROLE & RESPONSIBILITIES</p><h3>{{ selectedStaff.id === 990115 ? 'Billing, with a clear next step' : 'Practice support, with ownership' }}</h3><ul class="responsibility-list"><li v-for="item in selectedStaff.id === 990115 ? ['Review eligibility and coverage examples', 'Prepare and review the claim work queue', 'Track follow-up and illustrative payment status', 'Coordinate billing questions with the practice'] : ['Coordinate intake and new-client questions', 'Help clients navigate portal access', 'Organize appointment and administrative requests', 'Route clinical questions to the assigned provider']" :key="item"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span>{{ item }}</li></ul><RouterLink v-if="selectedStaff.id === 990115" class="primary-button" :to="`/${slug}/billing`" data-analytics-id="provider-documentation-open">Explore the billing workspace →</RouterLink><p class="profile-copy">These responsibilities illustrate separate practice roles. This public demo does not grant access to live practice records or send messages.</p></template>
            <template v-else-if="profileTab === 'access'"><p class="eyebrow">PRACTICE ACCESS</p><h3>The right information for the role</h3><dl class="credential-facts"><div><dt>Account</dt><dd>{{ selectedStaff.name }} · Active fictional account</dd></div><div><dt>Practice</dt><dd>Meadowbrook Therapy</dd></div><div><dt>Role</dt><dd>{{ selectedStaff.role_label }}</dd></div><div><dt>Responsibilities</dt><dd>{{ selectedStaff.id === 990115 ? 'Financial work queues, claims and billing follow-up' : 'Client support, intake coordination and scheduling requests' }}</dd></div><div><dt>Clinical work</dt><dd>Care and clinical sign-off stay with the appropriate provider or supervisor.</dd></div></dl><p class="profile-copy">The demo shows examples for exploration. Actual account permissions are assigned by the practice.</p></template>
            <template v-else-if="profileTab === 'plotline'"><section class="plotline-panel" data-analytics-area="plotline"><div class="plotline-heading"><img class="plotline-logo large" src="/assets/plotline/website/brand/logos/plotline-primary-transparent.webp" alt="Plotline" width="120" height="48"><div><p class="eyebrow">PEOPLE OPERATIONS · COMPANION WORKSPACE</p><h3 class="visually-hidden">Plotline</h3></div><span class="plotline-example">Fictional example</span></div><p>Support the people behind the practice. Keep onboarding, role expectations, learning and professional milestones together.</p><div class="plotline-profile"><span class="plotline-mini-avatar" aria-hidden="true">{{ initials(selectedStaff.name) }}</span><div><strong>{{ selectedStaff.name }}</strong><span>{{ selectedStaff.role_label }} · Meadowbrook Therapy</span></div></div><div class="plotline-stats"><div><strong>Complete</strong><span>Example onboarding</span></div><div><strong>{{ selectedStaff.is_provider ? '2' : '1' }}</strong><span>Learning items</span></div><div><strong>{{ selectedStaff.is_provider ? '120 days' : '30 days' }}</strong><span>{{ selectedStaff.is_provider ? 'To example renewal' : 'To role check-in' }}</span></div></div><h4>Professional checklist</h4><ul class="plotline-checklist"><li><span class="done" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><div><strong>Welcome & practice orientation</strong><span>Example onboarding checklist completed</span></div><span>Complete</span></li><li><span class="done" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><div><strong>Role expectations & access</strong><span>{{ selectedStaff.role_label }} responsibilities reviewed</span></div><span>Complete</span></li><li><span class="pending" aria-hidden="true">◷</span><div><strong>{{ selectedStaff.is_provider ? 'Continuing education & renewal' : 'Role development check-in' }}</strong><span>{{ selectedStaff.is_provider ? 'Track learning and upcoming credential milestones' : 'Review goals and opportunities for growth' }}</span></div><span>Upcoming</span></li><li v-if="selectedStaff.supervisor_id || selectedStaff.id === 990113"><span class="pending" aria-hidden="true">◷</span><div><strong>Clinical supervision check-in</strong><span>{{ selectedStaff.supervisor_id ? 'Tessa Brooks, PhD · Weekly reflective practice' : 'Milo Chen, LPCC · Supervision & learning goals' }}</span></div><span>Scheduled</span></li></ul><p class="plotline-footnote">This preview illustrates a connected people-operations workflow. No employee records, credentials or external accounts are opened.</p></section></template>
